Package: kulan-assistant
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @PUBLISHER@ <@MAINTAINER_EMAIL@>
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.12), gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), systemd, pipewire-bin
Recommends: kulan-assistant-engine, kulan-settings (= @VERSION@), poppler-utils, python3-nautilus, gir1.2-tsparql-3.0, tracker-miner-fs
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @NAME@ Assistant for private writing help and search
 Dictation, writing tools for text you select in any app, summaries of
 documents in Files, and file search in Activities.
 .
 Everything runs on this computer with the open Qwen3 model, downloaded once
 from Kulan Settings. Nothing you select, summarise or search for is sent
 anywhere.
